---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"rfkill\")"
---
Enable and disable wireless devices

Usage: rfkill [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  event    Listen for rfkill events and display them on stdout
  list     List the current state of all available devices (deprecated format)
  block    Disable the corresponding device
  unblock  Enable the corresponding device
  toggle   Enable or disable the corresponding device
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -J, --json             Use JSON output format
  -n, --noheadings       Don't print headings
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Define which output columns to use
      --output-all       Output all available columns
  -r, --raw              Use the raw output format
  -h, --help             Print help
